        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =====================================================================
       SECTION 9: CONCLUSION / PARTNER SECTION (DARK INDIGO + GROWTH IMAGE)
  ===================================================================== -->
  <section class="relative surface-indigo py-12 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 border-b border-slate-800/80 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-pattern-dark pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-7 sm:gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Left 7 Columns: Conclusion Paragraphs (Justified) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 min-w-0">
          <div class="badge-dark mb-3.5 sm:mb-4">Sustain Long-Term Market Leadership</div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[1.45rem] sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-snug sm:leading-tight mb-4 sm:mb-6">
            Turn Gurgaon Search Traffic into Booked Property Allotments
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-slate-300 text-[13.5px] sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-justify hyphens-auto [text-align-last:left]">
            <p>
              In Gurgaon's high-stakes property ecosystem, digital visibility is no longer just about generating vanity pageviews. It is about establishing unshakeable authority when discerning corporate leaders, venture partners, and NRI investors evaluate multi-crore real estate commitments. When your developments occupy the top positions on Google, command the Google Map Pack, and earn top citations from conversational AI engines, your sales team negotiates from strength.
            </p>
            <p>
              NK Digital Tech provides the strategic SEO firepower necessary to outrank generic property portals, eliminate wasteful advertising burn, and capture proprietary high-intent inquiries. Partner with Gurgaon's dedicated real estate search marketing specialists and build a digital asset that drives compounding property sales year after year.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right 5 Columns: Unique Growth Image -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 min-w-0">
          <div class="rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-700/80 shadow-2xl bg-slate-900">
