        <div class="badge-light mb-3">Questions Asked on Google, ChatGPT &amp; Gemini</div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[1.45rem] sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-snug sm:leading-tight mb-3 sm:mb-4">
